    "appInfoLocalization:en-US": {
      "fields": {
        "name": "Sato - Bitcoin Tracker",
        "privacyPolicyUrl": "https://mekarya.studio/privacy/sato",
        "subtitle": "Watch BTC wallets without keys"
      },
      "id": "50e06c58-3b25-41ec-bad5-03a9df15fc6f",
      "type": "appInfoLocalizations"
    },
    "appStoreReviewDetail:IOS:1.0": {
      "fields": {
        "contactEmail": "pratamaiosi@gmail.com",
        "contactFirstName": "Iosi",
        "contactLastName": "Pratama Putra",
        "contactPhone": "+6285121965123",
        "demoAccountRequired": false,
        "notes": "Sato is a read-only (\"watch-only\") Bitcoin tracker. It holds no private keys, cannot send or receive funds, and has no trading, exchange or custody features. There is no account system and no sign-in, so no demo account is needed.\n\nTo try the app:\n1. Tap Continue on the welcome screen, then create a wallet and give it any name.\n2. Paste any public Bitcoin address to see its balance. A well-known public address with a balance you can use for testing: 1A1zP1eP5QGefi2DMPTfTL5SLmv7DivfNa\n3. Pull to refresh to re-fetch the balance and price.\n4. Settings lets you switch the fiat currency, hide fiat, and show amounts in satoshis.\n\nData sources: on-chain balances come from public Esplora block explorers (mempool.space and mirrors); the BTC price comes from CoinGecko. Both are public, unauthenticated endpoints. Wallet names and addresses are stored only on the device.\n\nIn-app purchase: Sato Plus is a one-time non-consumable that lifts the one-wallet limit. The paywall appears when adding a second wallet, and can also be reached from Settings, where Restore Purchase is available."
      },
      "id": "4db0648c-f258-42c8-ab1e-fd6a67530d77",
      "type": "appStoreReviewDetails"
    },
    "appStoreVersion:IOS:1.0": {
      "fields": {
        "copyright": "2026 Iosi Pratama Putra",
        "releaseType": "AFTER_APPROVAL",
        "versionString": "1.0"
      },
      "id": "4f627bb0-e38c-44cd-8b73-868f723a478d",
      "type": "appStoreVersions"
    },
    "appStoreVersionLocalization:IOS:1.0:en-US": {
      "fields": {
        "description": "Sato is a calm, watch-only bitcoin tracker. See what you've saved without the noise.\n\nPaste a public address and see your balance. No account. No seed phrase. No keys. Sato can only look. It can never move your bitcoin.\n\nWHY SATO\n\nBitcoin goes up and down in dollars, and most apps make you feel every swing: charts, alerts, red numbers. But bitcoin tends to reward the people who do nothing. Sato is made for that. Open it now and then, see where you stand, close it again.\n\nWHAT YOU CAN DO\n\n- Track several wallets, each with one or more addresses\n- Organize by goal, like a house, college, or retirement, with your own icon and color\n- See balances in BTC or sats\n- Show value in 29 currencies, or hide fiat completely\n- See pending amounts separately, so nothing surprises you\n- Use Legacy, SegWit, and Taproot addresses\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\n\nNo account, no analytics, no servers of our own. Your wallets stay on your phone. Sato only asks public block explorers for balances and a price service for exchange rates. Nothing identifies you, because there's nothing to identify.\n\nSATO PLUS\n\nSato is free with one wallet. A single one-time purchase — never a subscription — unlocks as many wallets as you like.",
        "keywords": "sats,satoshi,hodl,cold,storage,hardware,address,portfolio,crypto,price,stack,savings,balance,monitor",
        "marketingUrl": "https://mekarya.studio/apps/sato",
        "promotionalText": "For long-term bitcoin holders saving for the future, Sato gives you peace, not price alerts or meme coins.",
        "supportUrl": "https://mekarya.studio/support/sato"
      },
      "id": "3e16736a-a727-44b4-b57e-4a2c8d999073",
      "type": "appStoreVersionLocalizations"
    },
